  "description": {
    "ja": "最大6Tトークンで学習した新世代モデル。RMSNorm、Z-loss正則化、学習率アニーリングなど安定性向上技術を導入。Llama 3.1 8Bを上回る性能。Tülu 3パイプラインでポストトレーニング。",
    "en": "New generation model trained on up to 6T tokens. Introduces stability improvements including RMSNorm, Z-loss regularization, and learning rate annealing. Outperforms Llama 3.1 8B. Post-trained with Tülu 3 pipeline."
  },

  "specs": {
    "contextLength": 4096,
    "languages": ["en"],
    "architecture": "Decoder-only Transformer with RMSNorm"
  },

